# Personal Portfolio

A personal portfolio website designed to showcase my software development projects, skills, and learning journey.

## About the Project

I wanted to build a portfolio that stands out from the usual developer websites. The red-and-black colour scheme gives it a bold, modern look, while the layout brings together my projects, skills, and experience in one place.

This project is also an opportunity to put what I've been learning into practice, from building the interface to making the website responsive and presenting my work in a clear, interactive way.

## Features

- Bold red-and-black design
- Responsive layout
- Project showcase
- Skills and certificates section
- Personal introduction
- Interactive elements and visual effects

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript

## Getting Started

1. Clone this repository.
2. Open the project folder.
3. Open `index.html` in your browser.

